backends: [int]
frontend: react
---
# rozum — control center

Live snapshot parsed into structured fields via `fetchJsonValue` (navigable
`JsonValue`) + `computedSignal`, with the installed catalog in a `dataTable`.

## Setup
[signal, emit, serve, fetchUrlSignal, incSignal, computedSignal](std/ui/primitives.ssc)
[fetchJsonValue](std/ui/fetch-json.ssc)
[jsonStringify](std/json.ssc)
[lower](std/ui/lower.ssc)
[defaultTheme](std/ui/theme.ssc)
[vstack, hstack, divider, spacer](std/ui/layout.ssc)
[heading, text](std/ui/typography.ssc)
[badge](std/ui/display.ssc)
[card, cardWithHeader](std/ui/containers.ssc)
[signalText_](std/ui/reactive.ssc)
[signalActionButton](std/ui/input.ssc)
[tableCol, dataTable](std/ui/data.ssc)

## Live data
```scalascript
val refresh = signal("refresh", 0)
val emptyH  = signal("emptyH", "")
val st      = fetchJsonValue("status", "/control/status", refresh, emptyH)

val availTxt     = computedSignal(() => st().get("residency").get("available_bytes").asString)
val budgetTxt    = computedSignal(() => st().get("residency").get("host_budget_bytes").asString)
val committedTxt = computedSignal(() => st().get("residency").get("committed_bytes").asString)
val installedArr = computedSignal(() => jsonStringify(st().get("installed")))

val gwCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Gateway / residency"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(
      text("source:"), badge("rozum control-API (always-up)", "success"),
      signalActionButton(incSignal(refresh), "↻ refresh")
    ),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("available bytes:"),   signalText_(availTxt)),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("host budget bytes:"), signalText_(budgetTxt)),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("committed bytes:"),   signalText_(committedTxt))
  )
)

val catCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Installed catalog"))(
  dataTable(installedArr, List(
    tableCol("Installed model", "spec"),
    tableCol("Size (bytes)",    "size_bytes")
  ))
)
```

## Meetings panel
```scalascript
val meetingsCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Meetings — room: rozum"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("sunny-civet"),  badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("nimble-raven"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-finch"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-fox"),   badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("Sergiy"),       badge("operator", "neutral"))
  )
)
```

## Compose + serve
```scalascript
val view = vstack(gap = 16)(
  heading(1, "rozum — control center"),
  text("LIVE structured models/gateway/residency via the rozum control-API"),
  divider(),
  gwCard,
  divider(),
  catCard,
  divider(),
  meetingsCard
)

serve(lower(view, defaultTheme), 8410)
```
